# SHUDDL — app build env (copy to .env.local; never commit real values, .gitignore blocks .env*).

# Optional. When set, the Command/Portal maps render on Mapbox's own vector tiles with this token
# instead of the self-hosted default (REQ-075 keeps the shipped default self-hosted). Use a PUBLIC
# (pk.) token, and URL-restrict it in your Mapbox account. Mapbox's ToS governs use of their tiles —
# confirm your plan permits it before shipping this path. Unset ⇒ self-hosted OpenFreeMap/Protomaps.
# Consumed by Vite at build time (apps/command, apps/portal). Example:
# VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=pk.your_public_token_here
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
